# Edge cases: reactive `$` and context `:`

Positive cases that compile and run. Negative context / `$`-on-interface
cases live in `test/wchnt_lang/edgecases_test.clj` (they must fail the cargo).

Covers:

1. ~~`Car = :Engine` + `Truck = :Engine`~~ — compile error (unit test)
2. `A = $B $C` — parent updates when either observable updates
3. `A = $B` and `C = $D` — independent; no crosstalk
4. Two `A`s sharing one `B` — both subscribe to the same identity
5. ~~`A = $I` with `I = B | C`~~ — compile error (unit test)
6. ~~`:` plus ordinary on another parent~~ — compile error (unit test)
7. `Holder = Clock` and `Watcher = $Clock` — Clock is observable; Holder does not subscribe

## Schema

```
EdgeCases = MultiObs Independent FanOut HolderWatch

MultiObs = $ClockA $Pulse
ClockA = Int/t
Pulse = Int/n

Independent = Left Right
Left = $Alpha
Right = $Beta
Alpha = Int/a
Beta = Int/b

FanOut = Sub/s1 Sub/s2
Sub = $Shared
Shared = Int/x

HolderWatch = Holder Watcher
Holder = Clock
Watcher = $Clock
Clock = Int/c
```

## Construction

```
shared = [:Shared 0].
clock = [:Clock 0].
[:EdgeCases
  [:MultiObs [:ClockA 0] [:Pulse 0]]
  [:Independent [:Left [:Alpha 0]] [:Right [:Beta 0]]]
  [:FanOut [:Sub shared] [:Sub shared]]
  [:HolderWatch [:Holder clock] [:Watcher clock]]]
```

## Methods

```
ClockA::update! = { [:ClockA (t + 1)] }
Pulse::update! = { [:Pulse (n + 1)] }
MultiObs::update! = { [:MultiObs clockA pulse] }

Alpha::update! = { [:Alpha (a + 1)] }
Beta::update! = { [:Beta (b + 1)] }
Left::update! = { [:Left alpha] }
Right::update! = { [:Right beta] }

Shared::update! = { [:Shared (x + 1)] }
Sub::update! = { [:Sub shared] }

Clock::update! = { [:Clock (c + 1)] }
Watcher::update! = { [:Watcher clock] }
```

## Target

```
%terminal

%main
public static function main():Void {
    var root = EdgeCasesAssemblage.factory();
    var helper = new WCHNTHelper();
    // (2) either $ child notifies MultiObs
    root.multiObs.clockA.update_mutates();
    root.multiObs.pulse.update_mutates();
    // (3) Alpha does not touch Right / Beta
    root.independent.left.alpha.update_mutates();
    // (4) one Shared notifies both Subs
    root.fanOut.s1.shared.update_mutates();
    // (7) Clock is observable; Watcher subscribed, Holder is not
    root.holderWatch.watcher.clock.update_mutates();
    trace(root.toConstruction(0, helper));
}
```
